[
    {
        "text": "Time - Unknown \\ Weather - Unknown \\ Visibility - Poor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chernobog - Operation Squad E0's Location"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname} Rescue Operation, Phase 3"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_cher_1",
            "width": 1,
            "height": 1,
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$chernormal_intro",
            "key": "$chernormal_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1,
            "delay": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We have less than an hour left. We can't afford to make a detour..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "The more time we waste, the more like we are to get caught in the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We must directly cut across this area."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "However, we won't be able to conceal our movements anymore given the size of our forces."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "The possibility of getting ambushed when we're navigating through narrow streets is very high..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "What's the plan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We don't have many options..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, what's your assessment?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "All we have to do is destroy them in a head-on attack!;...They can't stop us, probably...;It takes time for the enemy to regroup.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Reunion's forces are no match for us individually."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "But most of the time, they try to overwhelm us with sheer numbers."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "If we can utilize our speed to constantly press forward while avoiding large-scale fights..."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "They don't seem to have built any fortifications."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "If we're able to charge through their blockade..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Even though it looks like they have a numbers advantage, their loose formation won't be able to stop our advance."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "From what I've observed through our past battles, Reunion's communication methods are absolutely primitive."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "If we do this quickly, by the time they're able to regroup and mount an effort to stop us..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We'll already be long gone by the time they get into formation."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Sounds good."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "We'll storm them, disrupt their formation, destroy their firebase, and then fall back quickly."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Dobermann, are you testing me, or..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "It's far easier to deal with threats we can see than to be stuck between a rock and a hard place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "I take it that these are Dr. {@nickname}'s orders, Amiya?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "The situation is clear. I trust Doctor's decisions..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "...Trust isn't built so easily from just a single battle."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "I do think highly of Dr. {@nickname}, Amiya..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "But don't let your guard down. Of course, there is nothing wrong with learning from the Doctor's wisdom, but remember, you can't fully rely on anyone else in this world."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Don't get me wrong, Doctor, I'm not trying to make things difficult for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "But I hope you understand... Amiya still needs to learn and grow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "If you were in my position, you also wouldn't allow her to rely on someone else."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "However, know that I've already acknowledged your abilities as a commander."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Thank you...",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Also, there's no reason to be so formal. We're comrades-in-arms now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "At least on the battlefield, I've already entrusted my life to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Enough with the chit-chatting though, let's hurry it up."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "There's an old saying in Kazimierz: 'Death catches up to you when you stop to take a break.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.6
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image"
    }
]